# Python virtual environment Script Execution Order

1. `./01_install_prerequisites.sh` - Ensure required version of Python is installed
2. `./02_create_venv.sh` - Create virtual environment with above version of Python
2. `activate` - Activate the virtual environment (this is a function in the current shell)
3. `./03_load_requirements.sh` - Install/update Python packages

# Python virtual environment activation
- ❌ NEVER run `source` directly. Instead execute verbatim `activate` (a function in the current shell)